# VocabMania Project Context

Read `docs/VISION.md` for full product/roadmap decisions.

## North Star
Ship a daily-habit vocab app people return to. KMP + AI workflows are how we build.

## Planning
- **Phase 0–4** = planning units (see VISION.md for goals, deliverables, done-when)
- **Week N** = timing within a phase (one chat per week per AI_WORKFLOW.md)
- Current: **Phase 4, Week 1** — Ticket 1: Prefactor — ship Practice materials (see `docs/prds/phase-4-practice-ux-tickets.md`). Phase 3 Ticket 6 (playbook/skills) may still be open in parallel.

## Stack
- `:shared` — KMP commonMain: domain, SQLDelight, SRS scheduler, repository interfaces
- `:app` — new UI in Jetpack Compose; ViewModels call `:shared` use cases
- Legacy — Java/XML Activities; in APK but unreachable from Compose; **do not polish or extend**

## Hard Rules
1. New Compose screens serve the **new SRS concept** — not 1:1 ports of legacy screens
2. Business logic in `:shared/commonMain` — never in Composables or legacy Java
3. SQLDelight in commonMain for data; expect/actual only when platform requires it
4. Don't modify legacy Java/XML unless blocking migration (bug fix only)
5. Minimize scope — one week at a time per `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`

## Daily flow (Phase 4 contract)
Onboarding → Home (practice hero, N = min(due, goal)) → Practice (new: Got it; repeats: Missed/Almost/Got it) → Session complete

## When Stuck
Use grill-me (`.cursor/skills/grill-me.md`): one question at a time, with recommendation.

## Skill Promotion
If a pattern repeats twice, flag "Skill promotion opportunity" per `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`.

## Planning pipeline
`grill-me` → `to-prd-vocabmania` → `to-vertical-slices` → implement one ticket/week. See `docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`.
